      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Agreement on a Unified Patent Court (in force 2023-06-01). Establishes the UPC as a supranational court for infringement and revocation of European patents across contracting states. Key for medtech AI: opt-out strategy, PI threshold ('more likely than not' invalidity standard from 10x v. NanoString CoA), EPO-UPC divergence risk."
      }
    ],
