      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EU Trade Secrets Directive. Harmonises civil-law protection of undisclosed know-how and business information. Key for medical AI: model weights, training data schemas, and proprietary algorithms qualify as trade secrets under the Art.2 three-part test. Art.5 carve-outs limit the secrecy shield when exercise of the right to information is at stake — directly engaged by GDPR Art.15(1)(h) and AI Act Art.13 transparency obligations."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
