      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "Computer-implemented simulation of a technical process is not excluded from patentability (Art.52(2)). Technical character assessed at claim level. Foundational for AI-based clinical decision simulation systems."
      }
    ],
